{
  "info": {
    "name": "Prex GIPHY API",
    "description": "API REST del challenge PHP Hexagonal (Prex): login OAuth2, búsqueda de GIFs, GIF por ID y favoritos.\n\nUso:\n1. Importar esta colección y el environment `Prex GIPHY - Local`.\n2. Seleccionar el environment.\n3. Ejecutar **Auth / Login**: el token se guarda solo en `access_token`.\n4. El resto de los requests usa `Bearer {{access_token}}` (configurado a nivel colección).\n\nEl token vence a los 30 minutos: si un request devuelve 401, volvé a ejecutar el login.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token_expires_at', body.expires_at);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado en el environment. Vence:', body.expires_at);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('token Bearer de 30 minutos', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.expires_in).to.eql(1800);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Autentica con email y password y devuelve un token Bearer (OAuth2, Passport) que vence a los 30 minutos.\n\n**Entrada:** `email` (requerido, email válido), `password` (requerido).\n\n**Respuestas:**\n- 200: `token_type`, `access_token`, `expires_in` (1800), `expires_at` (ISO 8601).\n- 401 `invalid_credentials`: email o contraseña incorrectos (mismo mensaje en ambos casos).\n- 422 `validation_error`: datos inválidos.\n\nEl script de tests guarda el token en la variable de environment `access_token`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - credenciales inválidas (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"wrong-password\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Ejemplo de error: devuelve 401 `invalid_credentials`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "GIFs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Buscar GIFs",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('gif_id', body.data[0].id);",
                  "    console.log('gif_id guardado para los siguientes requests:', body.data[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/gifs/search?query=cats&limit=5&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "gifs", "search"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "query", "value": "cats", "description": "Requerido. Texto a buscar (máx. 50 caracteres)." },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "5", "description": "Opcional. Entre 1 y 50. Default 25." },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0", "description": "Opcional. Entre 0 y 4999. Default 0." }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Busca GIFs en GIPHY por una frase o término. Requiere token.\n\n**Respuestas:**\n- 200: `data` (lista de GIFs) y `pagination` (`total`, `count`, `offset`).\n- 401 `unauthenticated`: sin token o token vencido.\n- 422 `validation_error`: filtros inválidos.\n- 502 `gif_provider_unavailable`: GIPHY no responde.\n\nEl script guarda el id del primer resultado en `gif_id`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener GIF por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/gifs/{{gif_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "gifs", "{{gif_id}}"] },
            "description": "Obtiene la información de un GIF específico. Requiere token.\n\nEl ID de GIPHY es alfanumérico (por ejemplo `xT4uQulxzV39haRFjG`), aunque el enunciado lo describe como numérico.\n\n**Respuestas:**\n- 200: `data` con el GIF.\n- 401 `unauthenticated`.\n- 404 `gif_not_found`.\n- 502 `gif_provider_unavailable`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar GIFs - sin query (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/gifs/search?limit=5", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "gifs", "search"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "5" }] },
            "description": "Ejemplo de error: falta `query`, devuelve 422 `validation_error`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar GIFs - sin token (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/gifs/search?query=cats", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "gifs", "search"], "query": [{ "key": "query", "value": "cats" }] },
            "description": "Ejemplo de error: sin header Authorization, devuelve 401 `unauthenticated`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener GIF - inexistente (404)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/gifs/doesnotexist123", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "gifs", "doesnotexist123"] },
            "description": "Ejemplo de error: devuelve 404 `gif_not_found`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Favoritos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Guardar GIF favorito",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n    \"gif_id\": \"{{gif_id}}\",\n    \"alias\": \"mi gif favorito\",\n    \"user_id\": {{user_id}}\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/favorites", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "favorites"] },
            "description": "Guarda un GIF como favorito del usuario. Requiere token.\n\n**Entrada:** `gif_id` (requerido, alfanumérico), `alias` (requerido, texto), `user_id` (requerido, numérico; debe ser el usuario del token).\n\n**Respuestas:**\n- 201: favorito creado.\n- 401 `unauthenticated`.\n- 403 `forbidden`: `user_id` de otro usuario.\n- 404 `gif_not_found`: el GIF no existe en GIPHY.\n- 409 `favorite_already_exists`: ya era favorito.\n- 422 `validation_error`.\n\nEjecutá antes **Buscar GIFs** para cargar `gif_id`."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
